Package: flight-simulator-display
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Depends: flight-simulator-keys (>= 2.1.0), cage, chromium | chromium-browser, curl
Maintainer: variable31 <https://github.com/variable31/pi-xplane-fmc-cdu-keys-only>
Homepage: https://github.com/variable31/pi-xplane-fmc-cdu-keys-only
Description: Full-screen X-Plane CDU on the Pi's display (via WebFMC)
 Shows the CDU served by the WebFMC X-Plane plugin full screen on the
 Raspberry Pi's display at boot, with an automatic "Waiting for X-Plane"
 screen while the simulator is not running. Companion to
 flight-simulator-keys.
